{"id": "travel-eval-validation-004", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "42f53192a98510555eb630a6c7733ea6c2119682f5908643a287a547c309716e", "prompt_tokens": 400, "generated_tokens": 42, "generation_seconds": 1.7606, "answer": "鼓浪屿的核心价值不是某一个地标，而是整座岛的建筑、坡道、小巷、海岛街区氛围和步行体验。它更适合留主要时段慢慢逛。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-005", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "bbe4d53af27526113563b4fdec84fa5ad2e7ff227c676ba9385c94002c0fae5a", "prompt_tokens": 539, "generated_tokens": 32, "generation_seconds": 1.6299, "answer": "沙茶面适合做早餐、午餐或简餐，[1]。姜母鸭更适合作为正餐补充，[1]。", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-006", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "f627953ede8c4a1b1346c6ac39afad41af2609e60b7d0dbcb46d66bb97eab119", "prompt_tokens": 421, "generated_tokens": 52, "generation_seconds": 2.2762, "answer": "鼓浪屿适合慢游、拍照、住一晚，夜晚和清晨氛围不同，沉浸感强。[1]\n\n但搬运行李、上岛组织、返程节奏更复杂，适合愿意接受这些不便的人。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-007", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "single_evidence", "input_sha256": "729e670b50b88d279fcf4a46b4eceb5c2748b28b8e4127ff06edd628923706da", "prompt_tokens": 413, "generated_tokens": 32, "generation_seconds": 1.5976, "answer": "是的，环岛路和曾厝垵这一带适合住宿，因为可以结合沙滩、骑行、海边散步和轻松餐饮。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
