{"id": "travel-eval-validation-009", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "fed6eaee3dfcc32ece99c01e7eb83d09cadcabafb6b170900385fa60f539a9d3", "prompt_tokens": 491, "generated_tokens": 60, "generation_seconds": 2.6387, "answer": "住中山路和轮渡片区，生活和吃饭都方便，上岛也顺。[1]\n\n上岛前要确认鼓浪屿轮渡的码头、航线和班次，出发前先查清楚出发码头、上岛码头和返程码头。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-010", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "bf06088279270f5239a8ea710b56c3fff6c0952f2affa76b04fcdd37ac4234e4", "prompt_tokens": 562, "generated_tokens": 60, "generation_seconds": 2.9525, "answer": "第一天可安排老城和中山路，不建议当天上岛再赶回来。鼓浪屿建议安排为完整时段，岛上的步行、轮渡、拍照和建筑漫游都决定了它不适合被压缩成匆忙插空项目。[1]、[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-011", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "60bc72c2bfe54e176aa186ca76c4b1ad66e33ce575d19008f17ab858672b1326", "prompt_tokens": 452, "generated_tokens": 39, "generation_seconds": 1.9474, "answer": "岛内交通以地铁、公交和网约车为主，适合白天活动。[1]\n\n中山路、轮渡片区的夜间便利性更优，适合吃饭散步。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-012", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "270c2f082fa48db6d0f45cf64b9cc6ade5cb2c3cd4a3476ea85e92d5cd293561", "prompt_tokens": 429, "generated_tokens": 27, "generation_seconds": 1.6056, "answer": "如果行李大，建议减少行李，或考虑住岛外，再安排一晚。[1]、[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-013", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "multi_evidence", "input_sha256": "7a7be1538a1b0052756ae1dbf04ad54024c1c925f2fb503080e64ca40deb34e8", "prompt_tokens": 443, "generated_tokens": 40, "generation_seconds": 2.9654, "answer": "老城更顺，因为老城是觅食主线，能串起沙茶面、海蛎煎、甜汤等小吃，也方便边走边逛。[1]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [2], "hit_output_limit": false}}
{"id": "travel-eval-validation-014", "model": "adapter", "task_type": "constrained_planning", "input_sha256": "a8a864efc7fa62baedf144e5232bd33cedfc31841d7353b74c55a417f34a9946", "prompt_tokens": 450, "generated_tokens": 52, "generation_seconds": 3.1631, "answer": "2 天更适合只保留“本岛老城 + 鼓浪屿”主线。[1]\n\n如果只有 2 天，环岛路可以缩减，或者和曾厝垵、厦大周边合并安排。[2]", "hit_output_limit": false, "format_flags": {"empty_answer": false, "contains_think_tags": false, "invalid_reference_ids": [], "irrelevant_reference_ids": [], "missing_gold_reference_ids": [], "hit_output_limit": false}}
